       pam_rootok - Gain only root access

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppaamm__rroooottookk..ssoo [debug]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       pam_rootok is a PAM module that authenticates the user if their _U_I_D is
       _0. Applications that are created setuid-root generally retain the _U_I_D
       of the user but run with the authority of an enhanced effective-UID. It
       is the real _U_I_D that is checked.

